%% MUPP-014 Expose kids sizes on kids card
%% Where a visitor opens a child's sizes; labels are requirement IDs.
flowchart TD
    A[Start page: server reads the kids and their sizes R1] --> B{Which card?}
    B -- one kid, list folded --> C[Storlekar button between age and Önskelista R2]
    B -- several kids --> D[Icon beside Önskelista, 70-80 % for the wish button R3]
    B -- any open kid view --> E[Icon in the top right corner R4]
    C --> F[Dialog: Storlekar för name R5]
    D --> F
    E --> F
    F --> G{Any sizes saved?}
    G -- yes --> H[One row per size with a value]
    G -- no --> I[Inga storlekar inlagda än.]
    H --> J[Stäng or Esc: dialog closes, focus back on the button, list and marks unchanged]
    I --> J
